<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/ma01/023vs0060a14'>
//『――おれは天下布武。
//　<RUBY text='ぎん'>白銀</RUBY>の星の名で呼ばれている者だよ』
《I am she who will conquer the world. You know me as the Silver Star.》

